      "date": "2026-11-08",
      "authors": [
        "tinyBigGAMES"
      ],
      "why_read": "Learn how VindexLLM implements full GPU-accelerated transformer inference in pure Delphi using Vulkan compute shaders without external runtimes.",
      "hn_id": "50410646",
      "comments": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50410646",
